Description: Open reimplementation of a VEGAS Effects style compositing application
 OpenVegas Effects builds composite shots with 2D and 3D layers, text, masks,
 tracking, native .hfpl effects, transitions and Behaviors, and exports them.
 .
 Playback and the voiceover recorder load the system libVLC.
